3. DONE: Re-run model with measured ratio/penalty; then compensate-jit
   implemented on user override (25/113 per-query wins, kept)
4. OPEN: per-query winner tuning (tuned ceiling 6.94 s)
5. OPEN: stale-CSV re-measure

