directory_ type, DirData return type), src/qjit/query_jit_runtime.cpp
(bloomMasks table, CAS push with bt_encode, directory alloc/zero),
src/jit/ir_to_llvm.cpp (bloom_gv global, guard+main probe load i64
→ bloom check → untag, bloom_tag_ in cache key).

