- src/jit/ir_to_llvm.cpp (disk_cache_dir, TryDiskLoad, WriteToDisk, modify
  TryCacheLoad + InstallCacheHook, SetDiskCacheDir)
- include/jit/ir_to_llvm.h (SetDiskCacheDir declaration)
- include/adapters/duckdb_adapter.h (SetJITCacheDir, jit_cache_dir_ member)
- src/adapters/duckdb_adapter.cpp (wire disk dir in EnsureJITCompiler)
- src/aqp_middleware.cpp (split=none cache check/record, pass cache dir)
